  "description": "The fastest choice for our top athletes. Tunnel tested and proven in race conditions with our pros, the Studio NEXT V-PRi is our fastest machine ever, thanks to aerodynamic refinements, improved integrated fit, and innovative race-day hydration and storage solutions. With CeramicSpeed upgrades, power meters, and top-tier cockpits, drivetrains, and wheels, there’s no need to upgrade a thing—you’re race-ready.\nCeramicSpeed T47 Bottom Bracket provided standard\nCeramicSpeed OSPW (Oversized Pulley Wheel) provided standard\nCeramicSpeed hub bearings provided standard\nExclusive premium Studio NEXT paint color options\nCustom color-matched Intelligent Integration Cockpit (IIC) designed for aerodynamic optimization and full fit adjustability\nFully refined frame and updated fork comprised of cutting-edge carbon cloth, resulting in industry-leading weight savings and improved aero advantage in any conditions\nFrame-integrated FuelBay™ Bottle, easily refilled on the fly (22oz capacity size S, 25.5 oz size M & L)\nFrame-integrated FuelBay™ Nutrition storage, capable of storing up to six gels\nUniversal Derailleur Hanger (UDH) standard for improved shift reliability\nSHIFT downtube for improved airflow\nLeading Edge Absent (LEA) non-driveside chainstay for improved airflow and weight savings\nIncluded powermeter with every build\nInvisible cable routing\nConfident fit window\nLightweight QR.SP carbon seatpost\nIntegrated universal computer mount available\nFit-Ready option available\nQR Lifetime Warranty\nOrder online direct with with full-assembly shipping options or visit a QR retailer",
